%erg v1
Title: Reduce erg ready git spawns from O(N) to O(1)
Created: 2026-05-05
Author: claude

--- log ---
2026-05-05T00:00Z claude created

--- body ---
## Context
`isBranchClaimed` ran `git branch --list *ID*` and `git branch -r --list *ID*`
for every open ticket — O(N) subprocess spawns each costing ~10ms in git
startup time.  Discovered while profiling `erg ready` slowness.

## Actions
1. Replace per-ticket git calls with a single `git branch -a` in `loadBranchNames`
2. Check IDs with `strings.Contains` in memory
3. Strip `* ` and `+ ` markers; skip symref lines

## Test
`make test-ready` green — existing claimed/unclaimed tests cover the behaviour.

## Exit criteria
- `strace` shows exactly one git spawn for `erg ready`
- All 21 ready tests pass
